1
00:00:00,487 --> 00:00:03,617
(Penny:)Oh, thanks for asking
until I did.

2
00:00:04,458 --> 00:00:05,658
(Amy:)Hear, hear.

3
00:00:05,659 --> 00:00:06,889
(Leonard:)Cheers.

4
00:00:08,361 --> 00:00:10,891
(Alfred:)I, uh, I would also like
to make a toast.

5
00:00:10,897 --> 00:00:11,867
(Sheldon:)Aw.

6
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:13,765
(chuckles)
Leonard,

7
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:16,037
(Alfred:)I am so happy
that you have found a woman

8
00:00:16,036 --> 00:00:17,966
(Alfred:)who loves and cares for you.

9
00:00:17,971 --> 00:00:20,141
(Beverly:)What the hell is that
supposed to mean?

10
00:00:22,075 --> 00:00:23,905
(Alfred:)Why don't you take a pill?

11
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:25,610
(Beverly:)Like you did before sex?

12
00:00:25,612 --> 00:00:27,342
(Alfred:)What I really needed

13
00:00:27,347 --> 00:00:29,147
(Alfred:)was a blindfold.

14
00:00:29,149 --> 00:00:30,719
All right, everyone...

15
00:00:30,717 --> 00:00:32,187
calm down.

16
00:00:32,185 --> 00:00:33,915
Let's all remember what
it says in the Bible:

17
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,050
"He who is slow to anger

18
00:00:36,056 --> 00:00:38,286
is better than the mighty."

19
00:00:38,291 --> 00:00:41,491
(Beverly:)Oh, dear woman, can you please
read another book?

20
00:00:42,529 --> 00:00:45,899
(Mary:)When God writes one, I will.

21
00:00:48,235 --> 00:00:49,505
(clears throat)

22
00:00:51,972 --> 00:00:55,342
Um, if-if we want to order
the soufflé,

23
00:00:55,342 --> 00:01:01,022
(Penny:)we might want to get on that.

